title: "marketplace-uplift-auction"
abstract: >-
  A simulated three-sided delivery marketplace (consumers, merchants, dashers) with a
  confounded promo treatment and known ground-truth causal effects, built to develop
  and benchmark uplift models, causal estimators, and ad auction mechanisms.
